From: spark-ds41f <dev@local>
Subject: [PATCH] dsv41: enable pipeline parallelism with disk Engram and DSpark

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm @ 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
  plus candidate-62 series (expected tree 8fc99ca7546c5c538f0fe64e7c82954f1d2d7ae0).
Rationale:
  DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash partitions cleanly across PP=2 (layers 0..19 on stage 0,
  layers 20..39 + DSpark mtp.0..2 on stage 1) with zero cross-stage KV,
  indexer, Engram, or DSpark aux-layer dependencies. Eight small Python fixes
  enabled PP>1 in the V2 runner:
  1. EngramLayout unconditionally raised on disk Engram when PP>1.
  2. DeepseekV4Model enabled disk_engram and registered Engram hashes even on
     PP stages with no local Engram layers (file_backed_engram stays true on
     all stages so DirectModelLoader skips streaming Engram tables on stage 1).
  3. DeepseekV4Model did not declare supports_aux_hidden_states_over_pp or
     pack/collect aux hidden states through IntermediateTensors.
  4. DSparkDeepseekV4ForCausalLM had no own embed_tokens when the target's
     embed_tokens lives on an earlier PP stage.
  5. GPUModelRunner registered VLLM_LATE_ADMISSION_LAYER even under PP>1,
     where the hook layer is a PPMissingLayer on earlier stages.
  6. GPUModelRunner and ModelCudaGraphManager cleared model_inputs["input_ids"]
     on non-first PP stages even when requires_raw_input_tokens(model) is True
     (needed by DS4.1's vision-aware MoE router).
  7. GPUModelRunner only declared TileLang's post_update_num_computed_tokens
     kernel for pooling models, omitting non-last PP stages that call it in
     sample_tokens.
  8. kv_cache_utils.get_kv_cache_config_from_groups emitted KVCacheTensors
     from unfiltered UniformTypeKVCacheSpecs even when a projected PP group
     had empty layer_names (e.g. DSpark draft layers on stage 0), causing
     StopIteration in allocate_kv_cache.
Quality implications:
  None; target forward math, Engram lookup, and DSpark drafting are unchanged.
Tests:
  Verified patch applies cleanly on the prepared 1120 vLLM tree and proven
  live on 4x DGX Spark at PP=2, TP=2.
Upstream status:
  Local experiment patch; candidate for upstream submission after PP=2, TP=2
  live verification.

